; An independently written implementation of the algorithm, kept as a
; cross-check rather than as architecture: it is the only thing in the tree
; that could catch a bug in the F* extraction by disagreeing with it. Run under
; `dune test` so that any drift shows up immediately instead of at the next
; time someone remembers to run it by hand.
;
; See the roadmap's locked decisions. Do not add features here.
(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps tessarium.mjs bands.json %{project_root}/vectors/vectors.json)
 (action (run node %{dep:test_vectors.mjs})))
